^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ constructed from two paths: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ construct\(storage \*, path, path\) is valid: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] line \d+ WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
